From: pieroviano <piero.viano@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 08:35:53 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 5: VisualStyleInformation

Adds the static VisualStyleInformation class reporting the active theme state. On
this GTK layer a theme is always present, so IsSupportedByOS/IsEnabledByUser/
SupportsFlatMenus report true, MinimumColorDepth is 32, and the theme colors map
to SystemColors. All members are GTK-init-free and never null/throwing so
theme-probing code stays safe to call at any time (DisplayName deliberately does
not read Gtk.Settings, which would require an initialized toolkit).

Full suite green at 2320 (+3 tests).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../VisualStyleInformationFunctionalTests.cs  | 36 ++++++++++
 .../VisualStyles/VisualStyleInformation.cs    | 65 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 101 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 Net4x.Gtk.Windows.Forms.Tests/System/Windows/Forms/VisualStyleInformationFunctionalTests.cs
 create mode 100644 Net4x.Gtk.Windows.Forms/System/Windows/Forms/VisualStyles/VisualStyleInformation.cs

diff --git a/Net4x.Gtk.Windows.Forms.Tests/System/Windows/Forms/VisualStyleInformationFunctionalTests.cs b/Net4x.Gtk.Windows.Forms.Tests/System/Windows/Forms/VisualStyleInformationFunctionalTests.cs
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..8db011e5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Net4x.Gtk.Windows.Forms.Tests/System/Windows/Forms/VisualStyleInformationFunctionalTests.cs
@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@
+namespace System.Windows.Forms;
+
+using System.Windows.Forms.VisualStyles;
+
+/// <summary>
+/// Verifies <see cref="VisualStyleInformation" />, which reports the active theme state. On this GTK layer a
+/// theme is always present, so visual styles report as supported and enabled. No GTK widgets are created.
+/// </summary>
+public class VisualStyleInformationFunctionalTests
+{
+    [Fact]
+    public void ReportsSupportedAndEnabled()
+    {
+        Assert.True(VisualStyleInformation.IsSupportedByOS);
+        Assert.True(VisualStyleInformation.IsEnabledByUser);
+        Assert.True(VisualStyleInformation.SupportsFlatMenus);
+        Assert.Equal(32, VisualStyleInformation.MinimumColorDepth);
+    }
+
+    [Fact]
+    public void MetadataStringsAreNonNull()
+    {
+        // These never throw and never return null, so theme-probing code stays safe.
+        Assert.NotNull(VisualStyleInformation.ColorScheme);
+        Assert.NotNull(VisualStyleInformation.DisplayName);
+        Assert.NotNull(VisualStyleInformation.Company);
+        Assert.NotNull(VisualStyleInformation.Version);
+    }
+
+    [Fact]
+    public void ThemeColorsAreValid()
+    {
+        Assert.False(VisualStyleInformation.TextControlBorder.IsEmpty);
+        Assert.False(VisualStyleInformation.ControlHighlightHot.IsEmpty);
+    }
+}
diff --git a/Net4x.Gtk.Windows.Forms/System/Windows/Forms/VisualStyles/VisualStyleInformation.cs b/Net4x.Gtk.Windows.Forms/System/Windows/Forms/VisualStyles/VisualStyleInformation.cs
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..2108142e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Net4x.Gtk.Windows.Forms/System/Windows/Forms/VisualStyles/VisualStyleInformation.cs
@@ -0,0 +1,65 @@
